sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant UI as ml-pipeline-ui<br/>80/TCP → 3000/TCP
    participant API as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP · 8887/TCP gRPC · 8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as cache-server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.4<br/>3306/TCP
    participant SeaweedFS as SeaweedFS<br/>8333/TCP S3
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Envoy as metadata-envoy<br/>9090/TCP gRPC
    participant MLMD as metadata-grpc (MLMD)<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant Writer as metadata-writer
    participant Persist as persistence-agent
    participant Sched as scheduled-workflow

    Note over Client,MLMD: Pipeline Creation Flow

    Client->>UI: GET /apis/v1beta1/healthz (HTTP/3000)
    UI-->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>HTTP/8888
    API->>MySQL: Store pipeline metadata<br/>TCP/3306 (mysql-secret)
    MySQL-->>API: ACK
    API->>SeaweedFS: Store pipeline artifacts<br/>S3/8333 (mlpipeline-minio-artifact)
    SeaweedFS-->>API: ACK
    API-->>Client: Pipeline created

    Note over Client,MLMD: PipelineVersion Webhook Flow

    Client->>K8s: Create PipelineVersion CR
    K8s->>Webhook: POST /webhooks/validate-pipelineversion<br/>HTTPS/8443 (TLS)
    Webhook->>MySQL: Check cache<br/>TCP/3306 (mysql-secret)
    MySQL-->>Webhook: Cache result
    Webhook-->>K8s: Admit/Reject
    K8s->>Webhook: POST /webhooks/mutate-pipelineversion<br/>HTTPS/8443 (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8s: Mutated resource

    Note over Client,MLMD: Pipeline Run Execution Flow

    Client->>API: POST create run<br/>gRPC/8887
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
    K8s->>Argo: Schedule workflow
    Argo->>K8s: Create runner pods<br/>(SA: pipeline-runner)

    Note over Client,MLMD: Metadata Recording Flow

    Writer->>K8s: Watch Argo Workflows<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8s-->>Writer: Workflow events
    Writer->>Envoy: Write execution metadata<br/>gRPC/9090
    Envoy->>MLMD: Forward gRPC<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: Store metadata<br/>TCP/3306 (mysql-secret)
    MySQL-->>MLMD: ACK

    Note over Client,MLMD: Persistence & Scheduling

    Persist->>K8s: Watch Workflows/ScheduledWorkflows
    K8s-->>Persist: Status updates
    Persist->>API: Report run status

    Sched->>K8s: Watch ScheduledWorkflows
    K8s-->>Sched: Schedule events
    Sched->>K8s: Create Argo Workflows
